<title>THAILAND: Thai tapioca pellets ship loadings.</title>
<headline>Thai tapioca pellets ship loadings.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following ships were loading or announced at Bangkok port, the Thai tapioca association said.</p>
<p>  Departure	    Charter	 Date	  Tonnes</p>
<p> KALYNOS		 (IAT)	  09/03/97     40,000</p>
<p> DENG ZHOU HAI	 (ACT)	  12/03/97     57,000</p>
<p> WORLD WOOD	    (PC )	  13/03/97     53,000</p>
<p>In port</p>
<p> DELTA PEACE	   (STC)	  16/03/97     50,000</p>
<p> RICO DUCKLING	 (IAT)	  16/03/97     45,000</p>
<p> WORLD SWAN	    (IAT)	  17/03/97     43,000</p>
<p> MULBERRY		(ACT)	  25/03/97     44,000</p>
</text>
